R:A runnable demonstration of everything that works today.
R:As of SPEC.md Stage 6 this covers T, R, C, A, M, MS, J, JM, U and E.
R:Note 1: numeric variables are single letters - there are 26 of them (#A-#Z).
R:Note 2: a string variable is different: $NAME, up to 254 characters.
R:Note 3: T: with no operand writes a blank line.

C:#S=2+3
C:#H=#S/2
C:#R=#S\2
C:$GREETING=HELLO, WORLD

T:$GREETING
T:THE SUM OF TWO AND THREE IS #S.
T:HALF OF IT, TRUNCATED, IS #H.
T:AND THE REMAINDER IS #R.

T:
T:EXPRESSIONS HAVE NO OPERATOR PRECEDENCE, SO 1+2*3 IS:
C:#P=1+2*3
T:  #P   (not 7)

T:
T:AN UNDEFINED STRING PRINTS ITS OWN NAME:
T:  $NOT_SET_ANYWHERE

T:
T:AND NUMBERS WRAP AT 16 BITS WITHOUT COMPLAINING:
C:#W=32767
C:#W=#W+1
T:  #W

T:
T:JM: BRANCHES ON WHICH MATCH FIELD WON, BECAUSE M: SETS AN
T:ORDINAL RATHER THAN A BOOLEAN. TRY IT WITH YES, NO OR MAYBE:
A:$PICK
M:YES,NO,MAYBE
JM:*YES,*NO,*MAYBE
T:  NO MATCH, OR MORE FIELDS THAN LABELS, FALLS THROUGH.
J:*END

*YES
T:  YOU SAID YES - THAT WAS FIELD 1.
J:*END

*NO
T:  YOU SAID NO - THAT WAS FIELD 2.
J:*END

*MAYBE
T:  YOU SAID MAYBE - THAT WAS FIELD 3.

*END
T:
T:U: CALLS A MODULE, AND E: COMES BACK FROM ONE. IT IS ALSO HOW
T:A PROGRAM ENDS WHEN THERE IS NO MODULE TO RETURN FROM.
T:NOTE THE J: AFTER THE RETURNING E: - WITHOUT IT EXECUTION WOULD
T:FALL BACK INTO THE MODULE AND CALL IT AGAIN.
U:*COUNTER
T:THE MODULE HAS BEEN ENTERED #N TIMES.
J:*AFTER

*COUNTER
C:#N=#N+1
E:

*AFTER
T:
T:AND A J: LOOPS, AS LONG AS ITS CONDITION HOLDS:
C:#I=0
*TOP
C:#I=#I+1
T:  COUNT #I
J(#I<5):*TOP

E:
